flowchart TD
    Dev[Maintainer changes source] --> Review[Review and static checks]
    Review --> Build{Tailwind source changed?}
    Build -->|Yes| CSS[Generate docs/style.css]
    Build -->|No| Artifact[Review docs/ artifact]
    CSS --> Artifact
    Artifact --> Host[Configured static host]
    Host --> HTTPS[Serve site over HTTPS]
    HTTPS --> Verify[Post-deployment smoke test]
    Verify -->|Failure| Rollback[Restore last known-good artifact]
    Verify -->|Success| Live([Release verified])
